      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Resume is by key: after a pause or crash the code reruns from the top, and finished steps answer from what they said before.\nOne failing slot is reported while the others are published. A pause for a person or a setup (NeedsSetup) goes up to the workflow.\nIts own turns are taken by code, so orchestration costs nothing. Budget: $3 a run, covers every child.",
      "originalText": "Resume is by key: after a pause or crash the code reruns from the top, and finished steps answer from what they said before.\nOne failing slot is reported while the others are published. A pause for a person or a setup (NeedsSetup) goes up to the workflow.\nIts own turns are taken by code, so orchestration costs nothing. Budget: $3 a run, covers every child.",
