      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Hooks are pure and synchronous (no I/O, clock or randomness): same save point -> same request on resume or fork.\nA refused final goes back as 'Not accepted: ...' and counts against invalidOutputs; the last step forces a final.",
